{"id":"pronouns","title":"I, you, he, she — and whose?","blocks":[{"t":"table","head":["","Singular","Plural"],"rows":[["1st","**я** — I","**мы** — we"],["2nd","**ты** — you (informal)","**вы** — you (formal or plural)"],["3rd","**он** — he · **она́** — she · **оно́** — it","**они́** — they"]],"rowHeads":true},{"t":"p","text":"**Он, она, оно** replace *any* noun of that gender, not only people: *Где стол?* — ***Он*** *там.* (*Where's the table? — It's over there.*) English would say *it*; Russian follows the noun's gender."},{"t":"h","text":"Whose? — my, your, our"},{"t":"p","text":"*Whose* is **чей**, and like *my* it agrees with the thing owned:"},{"t":"table","head":["","m.","f.","n.","pl."],"rows":[["whose?","чей","чья","чьё","чьи"],["my","мой","моя́","моё","мои́"],["your (ты)","твой","твоя́","твоё","твои́"],["our","наш","на́ша","на́ше","на́ши"],["your (вы)","ваш","ва́ша","ва́ше","ва́ши"]],"rowHeads":true},{"t":"p","text":"*His, her, their* never change: **его́** (his), **её** (her), **их** (their). *Его* брат, *его* сестра, *его* книги — all the same."},{"t":"ex","items":[["Чья это ручка? — Это моя ручка.","Whose pen is this? — It's my pen."],["Чьи это ключи? — Это её ключи.","Whose keys are these? — They're her keys."]]}],"exercises":[{"type":"mc","q":"*Где книга?* — ___ на столе.","options":["Он","Она","Оно"],"answer":1,"why":"**Книга** is feminine, so *it* is **она**.","id":"q1"},{"type":"mc","q":"*Где окно?* — ___ там.","options":["Он","Она","Оно"],"answer":2,"why":"Neuter **окно** → **оно**.","id":"q2"},{"type":"mc","q":"___ это машина? (Whose car is this?)","options":["Чей","Чья","Чьё"],"answer":1,"why":"**Машина** is feminine → **чья**.","id":"q3"},{"type":"mc","q":"___ это дети? (Whose children are these?)","options":["Чей","Чья","Чьи"],"answer":2,"why":"Plural → **чьи**.","id":"q4"},{"type":"fill","q":"Это ___ дом. (our house)","answers":["наш"],"why":"Masculine **дом** → **наш**.","id":"q5"},{"type":"fill","q":"Это ___ сестра. (your sister — speaking to a friend)","answers":["твоя"],"why":"Informal *your* + feminine → **твоя**.","id":"q6"},{"type":"fill","q":"Это ___ письмо. (your letter — formal)","answers":["ваше"],"why":"Formal *your* + neuter → **ваше**.","id":"q7"},{"type":"mc","q":"*Her books* is…","options":["её книги","ей книги","она книги"],"answer":0,"why":"**Её** never changes: её книга, её книги.","id":"q8"},{"type":"mc","q":"*Their son* is…","options":["их сын","ихний сын","они сын"],"answer":0,"why":"**Их** — their — never changes. (*Ихний* is substandard.)","id":"q9"},{"type":"fill","q":"Это ___ брат. (his brother)","answers":["его"],"why":"**Его** — his — never changes.","id":"q10"}]}